    {
      "id": "exo-nombres",
      "titre": "Nombres",
      "exercices": [
        {
          "enonce": "🟢 Niveau Facile\n\nCalculer : A = 20 − 6 + (−4) × 2",
          "solution": "On effectue la multiplication en premier :\n(−4) × 2 = −8\n\nA = 20 − 6 + (−8) = 14 − 8 = 6"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟡 Niveau Moyen\n\nCalculer en détaillant les étapes :\nA = 12 − 20 + (−8) × 3\nB = 4 − 5 × ((−3) + 9) + 2",
          "solution": "A = 12 − 20 + (−24) = (−8) + (−24) = −32\n\nB = 4 − 5 × 6 + 2 = 4 − 30 + 2 = −26 + 2 = −24"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟠 Niveau Difficile\n\nOn donne la liste de nombres suivante :\n−5 ; 7/2 ; 0,25 ; π ; −12/4 ; √2 ; 9\n\na) Parmi ces nombres, lesquels sont des entiers relatifs (Z) ?\nb) Lesquels sont des nombres rationnels (Q) ?\nc) Lesquels sont irrationnels ?",
          "solution": "a) Entiers relatifs : −5 ; −12/4 (= −3) ; 9\n\nb) Nombres rationnels : −5 ; 7/2 ; 0,25 ; −12/4 ; 9 (tous peuvent s'écrire sous forme de fraction p/q)\n\nc) Irrationnels : π ; √2 (développement décimal infini non périodique)\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='205' viewBox='0 0 260 205' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><ellipse cx='130' cy='92' rx='122' ry='88' fill='#e0f2fe' stroke='#0284c7' stroke-width='2'/><ellipse cx='112' cy='98' rx='90' ry='62' fill='#dcfce7' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2'/><ellipse cx='92' cy='101' rx='54' ry='38' fill='#fef9c3' stroke='#ca8a04' stroke-width='2'/><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='11'><text x='130' y='22' font-size='10' font-weight='bold' fill='#0369a1'>R (réels)</text><text x='112' y='52' font-size='10' font-weight='bold' fill='#15803d'>Q (rationnels)</text><text x='92' y='78' font-size='10' font-weight='bold' fill='#a16207'>Z (relatifs)</text><text x='92' y='94'>−5</text><text x='92' y='108'>−12/4</text><text x='92' y='122'>9</text><text x='172' y='92'>7/2</text><text x='172' y='108'>0,25</text><text x='228' y='92'>π</text><text x='228' y='108'>√2</text><text x='130' y='199' font-size='12' font-weight='bold'>Z ⊂ Q ⊂ R</text></g></svg></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🔴 Niveau Expert (BEPC)\n\nOn donne : D = (5² − 3 × (−4)) ÷ (√9 + 2)\n\na) Calculer la valeur exacte de D.\nb) D est-il un nombre entier ? Justifier.",
          "solution": "a) 5² = 25\n3 × (−4) = −12\n25 − (−12) = 25 + 12 = 37\n\n√9 = 3\n3 + 2 = 5\n\nD = 37/5 = 7,4\n\nb) D n'est pas un nombre entier car 37 n'est pas un multiple de 5 : 37/5 = 7,4, qui n'est pas un nombre entier."
        }
      ]
    },    
    {
      "id": "exo-operations",
      "titre": "Opérations",
      "exercices": [
        {
          "enonce": "🟢 Niveau Facile\n\nUn article coûte 8000 Ar. Calculer son prix après une réduction de 25%.",
          "solution": "Réduction = 8000 × 25/100 = 2000 Ar\nNouveau prix = 8000 − 2000 = 6000 Ar\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='92' viewBox='0 0 260 92' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='11'><text x='130' y='14' font-size='12' font-weight='bold'>Prix initial : 8000 Ar (100 %)</text></g><rect x='10' y='22' width='180' height='30' fill='#bbf7d0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='190' y='22' width='60' height='30' fill='#fecaca' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='1.5'/><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='11'><text x='100' y='42' font-weight='bold'>75 % à payer</text><text x='220' y='42' font-weight='bold'>25 %</text><text x='100' y='70'>6000 Ar</text><text x='220' y='70'>2000 Ar</text><text x='100' y='83' font-size='10'>(prix payé)</text><text x='220' y='83' font-size='10'>(réduction)</text></g></svg></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟡 Niveau Moyen\n\nUn artisan utilise de la peinture proportionnellement à la surface à peindre : pour 6 m², il utilise 1,5 L de peinture.\na) Quel est le coefficient de proportionnalité (en L/m²) ?\nb) Quelle quantité de peinture faut-il pour 18 m² ?",
          "solution": "a) Coefficient = 1,5 ÷ 6 = 0,25 L par m²\n\nb) Quantité = 18 × 0,25 = 4,5 L\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='220' height='125' viewBox='0 0 220 125' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect x='10' y='30' width='80' height='30' fill='#f1f5f9' stroke='#94a3b8'/><rect x='90' y='30' width='60' height='30' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#94a3b8'/><rect x='150' y='30' width='60' height='30' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#94a3b8'/><rect x='10' y='60' width='80' height='30' fill='#f1f5f9' stroke='#94a3b8'/><rect x='90' y='60' width='60' height='30' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#94a3b8'/><rect x='150' y='60' width='60' height='30' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#94a3b8'/><g fill='#1f2937' font-size='11'><text x='14' y='49'>Surface (m²)</text><text x='14' y='79'>Peinture (L)</text></g><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='12' font-weight='bold'><text x='120' y='49'>6</text><text x='180' y='49'>18</text><text x='120' y='79'>1,5</text><text x='180' y='79' fill='#15803d'>4,5</text></g><path d='M120 27 Q150 5 180 27' fill='none' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='1.5'/><polygon points='180,28 171.2,25.4 176,19' fill='#dc2626'/><path d='M120 93 Q150 115 180 93' fill='none' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='1.5'/><polygon points='180,93 171.2,94.6 176,101' fill='#dc2626'/><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#dc2626' font-size='11' font-weight='bold'><text x='150' y='12'>× 3</text><text x='150' y='121'>× 3</text></g></svg></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟠 Niveau Difficile\n\nUn article coûte 24 000 Ar. Il subit d'abord une réduction de 15%, puis son nouveau prix augmente de 10%.\nCalculer le prix final de l'article.",
          "solution": "Réduction : 24 000 × 15/100 = 3 600 Ar\nPrix après réduction : 24 000 − 3 600 = 20 400 Ar\n\nAugmentation : 20 400 × 10/100 = 2 040 Ar\nPrix final : 20 400 + 2 040 = 22 440 Ar\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='250' height='95' viewBox='0 0 250 95' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect x='4' y='36' width='66' height='34' rx='6' fill='#f1f5f9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='90' y='36' width='66' height='34' rx='6' fill='#fef9c3' stroke='#ca8a04' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='176' y='36' width='66' height='34' rx='6' fill='#dcfce7' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><line x1='70' y1='53' x2='84' y2='53' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='2'/><polygon points='90,53 83,49 83,57' fill='#475569'/><line x1='156' y1='53' x2='170' y2='53' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='2'/><polygon points='176,53 169,49 169,57' fill='#475569'/><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='11' font-weight='bold'><text x='37' y='57'>24 000 Ar</text><text x='123' y='57'>20 400 Ar</text><text x='209' y='57'>22 440 Ar</text><text x='80' y='28' font-size='10' fill='#dc2626'>− 15 %</text><text x='166' y='28' font-size='10' fill='#15803d'>+ 10 %</text></g><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#475569' font-size='9'><text x='37' y='86'>départ</text><text x='123' y='86'>après réduction</text><text x='209' y='86'>prix final</text></g></svg></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🔴 Niveau Expert (BEPC)\n\nUn cycliste roule à vitesse constante. Il parcourt 15 km en 40 minutes.\na) Quelle est sa vitesse en km/h ?\nb) À cette vitesse, combien de temps (en minutes) mettra-t-il pour parcourir 27 km ?\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='100' viewBox='0 0 260 100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><text x='20' y='34' text-anchor='middle' font-size='20'>🚴</text><text x='150' y='28' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#475569'>vitesse constante</text><line x1='20' y1='52' x2='140' y2='52' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='4'/><line x1='140' y1='52' x2='236' y2='52' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='3' stroke-dasharray='6 4'/><circle cx='20' cy='52' r='5' fill='#1f2937'/><circle cx='140' cy='52' r='5' fill='#1f2937'/><circle cx='236' cy='52' r='5' fill='#1f2937'/><g text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#1f2937' font-weight='bold'><text x='20' y='74'>0 km</text><text x='140' y='74'>15 km</text><text x='236' y='74'>27 km</text></g><g text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#b45309'><text x='20' y='90'>0 min</text><text x='140' y='90'>40 min</text><text x='236' y='90'>? min</text></g></svg></div></div>",
          "solution": "a) On convertit 40 minutes en heures : 40/60 = 2/3 h\nVitesse = distance ÷ temps = 15 ÷ (2/3) = 15 × 3/2 = 22,5 km/h\n\nb) Temps = distance ÷ vitesse = 27 ÷ 22,5 = 1,2 h\n1,2 h = 1,2 × 60 = 72 minutes\n\nIl mettra 72 minutes pour parcourir 27 km."
        }
      ]
    },    
    {
      "id": "exo-algebre",
      "titre": "Algèbre",
      "exercices": [
        {
          "enonce": "🟢 Niveau Facile\n\nRésoudre l'équation : 4x + 3 = 15",
          "solution": "4x + 3 = 15\n4x = 15 − 3\n4x = 12\nx = 12 / 4 = 3\n\nS = {3}\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='175' viewBox='0 0 260 175' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><polygon points='130,32 112,125 148,125' fill='#cbd5e1' stroke='#64748b'/><rect x='92' y='125' width='76' height='7' rx='3' fill='#64748b'/><rect x='52' y='28' width='156' height='6' rx='3' fill='#475569'/><g stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.5'><line x1='70' y1='34' x2='30' y2='100'/><line x1='70' y1='34' x2='110' y2='100'/><line x1='190' y1='34' x2='150' y2='100'/><line x1='190' y1='34' x2='230' y2='100'/></g><rect x='28' y='100' width='84' height='6' rx='3' fill='#475569'/><rect x='148' y='100' width='84' height='6' rx='3' fill='#475569'/><g fill='#fde68a' stroke='#d97706'><rect x='36' y='84' width='16' height='16'/><rect x='54' y='84' width='16' height='16'/><rect x='72' y='84' width='16' height='16'/><rect x='90' y='84' width='16' height='16'/></g><g fill='#bbf7d0' stroke='#16a34a'><circle cx='54' cy='76' r='6'/><circle cx='72' cy='76' r='6'/><circle cx='90' cy='76' r='6'/></g><rect x='170' y='70' width='40' height='30' rx='4' fill='#fed7aa' stroke='#ea580c'/><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-weight='bold'><text x='44' y='96' font-size='11'>x</text><text x='62' y='96' font-size='11'>x</text><text x='80' y='96' font-size='11'>x</text><text x='98' y='96' font-size='11'>x</text><text x='54' y='79' font-size='8'>1</text><text x='72' y='79' font-size='8'>1</text><text x='90' y='79' font-size='8'>1</text><text x='190' y='91' font-size='15'>15</text><text x='130' y='152' font-size='13'>4x + 3 = 15</text><text x='130' y='168' font-size='10' font-weight='normal'>On retire 3 de chaque côté : 4x = 12</text></g></svg></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟡 Niveau Moyen\n\nRésoudre les équations suivantes :\na) 5x − 7 = 2x + 8\nb) 3(x + 2) = 2x − 1",
          "solution": "a) 5x − 7 = 2x + 8\n5x − 2x = 8 + 7\n3x = 15\nx = 5\nS = {5}\n\nb) 3(x + 2) = 2x − 1\n3x + 6 = 2x − 1\n3x − 2x = −1 − 6\nx = −7\nS = {−7}"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟠 Niveau Difficile\n\nOn considère la fonction affine f définie par f(x) = −3x + 5.\na) Calculer f(0) et f(2).\nb) Quelle est l'image de −1 par f ?\nc) Déterminer l'antécédent de 11 par f.\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='95' viewBox='0 0 260 95' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><text x='130' y='14' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#475569'>Machine f</text><circle cx='16' cy='50' r='13' fill='#e0f2fe' stroke='#0284c7' stroke-width='1.5'/><line x1='29' y1='50' x2='38' y2='50' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='2'/><polygon points='44,50 38,46 38,54' fill='#475569'/><rect x='44' y='30' width='60' height='40' rx='6' fill='#fef9c3' stroke='#ca8a04' stroke-width='1.5'/><line x1='104' y1='50' x2='118' y2='50' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='2'/><polygon points='124,50 118,46 118,54' fill='#475569'/><rect x='124' y='30' width='60' height='40' rx='6' fill='#dcfce7' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.5'/><line x1='184' y1='50' x2='192' y2='50' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='2'/><polygon points='198,50 192,46 192,54' fill='#475569'/><ellipse cx='225' cy='50' rx='27' ry='14' fill='#fee2e2' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='1.5'/><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-weight='bold' font-size='12'><text x='16' y='55'>x</text><text x='74' y='55'>× (−3)</text><text x='154' y='55'>+ 5</text><text x='225' y='55'>f(x)</text></g><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#475569' font-size='9'><text x='16' y='88'>entrée</text><text x='225' y='88'>sortie</text></g></svg></div></div>",
          "solution": "a) f(0) = −3×0 + 5 = 5\nf(2) = −3×2 + 5 = −6 + 5 = −1\n\nb) f(−1) = −3×(−1) + 5 = 3 + 5 = 8\n\nc) On cherche x tel que f(x) = 11 :\n−3x + 5 = 11\n−3x = 6\nx = −2\nL'antécédent de 11 est −2.\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='205' viewBox='0 0 260 205' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><line x1='35' y1='159' x2='225' y2='159' stroke='#1f2937' stroke-width='1.5'/><polygon points='230,159 222,155 222,163' fill='#1f2937'/><line x1='130' y1='200' x2='130' y2='10' stroke='#1f2937' stroke-width='1.5'/><polygon points='130,4 126,12 134,12' fill='#1f2937'/><g stroke='#1f2937'><line x1='70' y1='155' x2='70' y2='163'/><line x1='100' y1='155' x2='100' y2='163'/><line x1='160' y1='155' x2='160' y2='163'/><line x1='190' y1='155' x2='190' y2='163'/></g><line x1='60' y1='15' x2='210' y2='195' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='70' y1='27' x2='70' y2='159' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='70' y1='27' x2='130' y2='27' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><g fill='#dc2626'><circle cx='70' cy='27' r='4'/><circle cx='100' cy='63' r='4'/><circle cx='130' cy='99' r='4'/><circle cx='190' cy='171' r='4'/></g><g font-size='10' fill='#1f2937'><text x='62' y='152' text-anchor='middle'>−2</text><text x='100' y='152' text-anchor='middle'>−1</text><text x='160' y='152' text-anchor='middle'>1</text><text x='190' y='152' text-anchor='middle'>2</text><text x='64' y='32' text-anchor='end' fill='#dc2626'>(−2 ; 11)</text><text x='94' y='68' text-anchor='end' fill='#dc2626'>(−1 ; 8)</text><text x='138' y='95' fill='#dc2626'>(0 ; 5)</text><text x='198' y='174' fill='#dc2626'>(2 ; −1)</text><text x='236' y='172'>x</text><text x='138' y='12'>y</text></g><text x='225' y='42' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' font-weight='bold' fill='#2563eb'>y = −3x + 5</text></svg></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🔴 Niveau Expert (BEPC)\n\nRésoudre l'équation suivante, en utilisant les identités remarquables :\n(x + 3)² − (x − 2)² = 25",
          "solution": "On développe chaque carré :\n(x + 3)² = x² + 6x + 9\n(x − 2)² = x² − 4x + 4\n\nOn calcule la différence :\n(x² + 6x + 9) − (x² − 4x + 4) = x² + 6x + 9 − x² + 4x − 4 = 10x + 5\n\nL'équation devient :\n10x + 5 = 25\n10x = 20\nx = 2\n\nS = {2}"
        }
      ]
    },    
    {
      "id": "exo-geometrie",
      "titre": "Géométrie et Mesure",
      "exercices": [
        {
          "enonce": "🟢 Niveau Facile\n\nCalculer l'angle au centre d'un polygone régulier à 8 côtés (un octogone).\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='220' height='200' viewBox='0 0 220 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><polygon points='190,100 166.6,43.4 110,20 53.4,43.4 30,100 53.4,156.6 110,180 166.6,156.6' fill='#e0f2fe' stroke='#0369a1' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='110' y1='100' x2='190' y2='100' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='110' y1='100' x2='166.6' y2='43.4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M135 100 A25 25 0 0 0 127.7 82.3' fill='none' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='110' cy='100' r='3' fill='#1f2937'/><g fill='#1f2937' font-size='12' font-weight='bold'><text x='98' y='116'>O</text><text x='146' y='90' fill='#dc2626' font-size='14'>?</text></g><text x='110' y='196' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#475569'>Octogone régulier (8 côtés)</text></svg></div></div>",
          "solution": "Angle au centre = 360° / n = 360° / 8 = 45°"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟡 Niveau Moyen\n\nABC est un triangle. M est un point de [AB] et N un point de [AC] tels que (MN) soit parallèle à (BC).\nOn donne : AM = 4 cm, AB = 10 cm, AC = 7,5 cm.\nCalculer AN.\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='212' viewBox='0 0 260 212' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><polygon points='130,15 20,150 240,150' fill='#f8fafc' stroke='#1f2937' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='86' y1='69' x2='174' y2='69' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='86' cy='69' r='3' fill='#dc2626'/><circle cx='174' cy='69' r='3' fill='#dc2626'/><g font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#1f2937'><text x='130' y='11' text-anchor='middle'>A</text><text x='8' y='164'>B</text><text x='244' y='164'>C</text><text x='80' y='73' text-anchor='end'>M</text><text x='180' y='73'>N</text></g><g font-size='11' fill='#2563eb'><text x='97' y='38' text-anchor='end'>4</text><text x='62' y='80' text-anchor='end'>10</text><text x='198' y='82'>7,5</text><text x='162' y='42' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='bold'>?</text></g><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937'><text x='130' y='184' font-size='11'>(MN) // (BC)</text><text x='130' y='202' font-size='10'>AM = 4 cm ; AB = 10 cm ; AC = 7,5 cm</text></g></svg></div></div>",
          "solution": "D'après le théorème de Thalès :\nAM/AB = AN/AC\n4/10 = AN/7,5\nAN = 4 × 7,5 / 10\nAN = 30/10 = 3\n\nAN = 3 cm."
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟠 Niveau Difficile\n\nUn cône a un rayon de base R = 3 cm et une hauteur h = 8 cm (on prendra π ≈ 3,14).\nCalculer son volume.\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='240' height='170' viewBox='0 0 240 170' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M80 140 L130 20 L180 140 A50 15 0 0 1 80 140 Z' fill='#e0f2fe' stroke='#0369a1' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M80 140 A50 15 0 0 1 180 140' fill='none' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='130' y1='20' x2='130' y2='140' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='130' y1='140' x2='180' y2='140' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='130' cy='140' r='3' fill='#1f2937'/><g stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.5'><line x1='58' y1='20' x2='58' y2='140'/><line x1='52' y1='20' x2='64' y2='20'/><line x1='52' y1='140' x2='64' y2='140'/></g><g stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='2 3'><line x1='64' y1='20' x2='130' y2='20'/></g><g font-size='11' font-weight='bold'><text x='52' y='84' text-anchor='end' fill='#b45309'>h = 8 cm</text><text x='186' y='144' fill='#dc2626'>R = 3 cm</text></g></svg></div></div>",
          "solution": "V = (1/3) × π × R² × h\nV = (1/3) × 3,14 × 3² × 8\nV = (1/3) × 3,14 × 9 × 8\nV = (1/3) × 226,08\nV = 75,36\n\nLe volume du cône est environ 75,36 cm³."
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🔴 Niveau Expert (BEPC)\n\nUne boule a un volume de 288π cm³. On lui applique un agrandissement de rapport k = 2.\na) Calculer le rayon R de la boule initiale.\nb) Calculer le volume exact de la boule agrandie, puis sa valeur approchée (on prendra π ≈ 3,14).",
          "solution": "a) V = (4/3) × π × R³ = 288π\n(4/3) × R³ = 288\nR³ = 288 × 3/4 = 216\nR = ∛216 = 6\n\nR = 6 cm.\n\nb) Lors d'un agrandissement de rapport k, les volumes sont multipliés par k³.\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='250' height='78' viewBox='0 0 250 78' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect x='5' y='6' width='72' height='64' rx='8' fill='#e0f2fe' stroke='#0284c7' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='89' y='6' width='72' height='64' rx='8' fill='#e0f2fe' stroke='#0284c7' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='173' y='6' width='72' height='64' rx='8' fill='#fed7aa' stroke='#ea580c' stroke-width='2'/><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937'><text x='41' y='24' font-size='11' font-weight='bold'>Longueurs</text><text x='125' y='24' font-size='11' font-weight='bold'>Aires</text><text x='209' y='24' font-size='11' font-weight='bold'>Volumes</text><text x='41' y='39' font-size='10' fill='#475569'>× k</text><text x='125' y='39' font-size='10' fill='#475569'>× k²</text><text x='209' y='39' font-size='10' fill='#475569'>× k³</text><text x='41' y='61' font-size='18' font-weight='bold' fill='#dc2626'>× 2</text><text x='125' y='61' font-size='18' font-weight='bold' fill='#dc2626'>× 4</text><text x='209' y='61' font-size='18' font-weight='bold' fill='#dc2626'>× 8</text></g></svg></div></div>\n\nV' = 288π × 2³ = 288π × 8 = 2304π cm³\n\nAvec π ≈ 3,14 :\nV' ≈ 2304 × 3,14 ≈ 7234,56 cm³\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='240' height='190' viewBox='0 0 240 190' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><circle cx='50' cy='90' r='30' fill='#bfdbfe' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><ellipse cx='50' cy='90' rx='30' ry='9' fill='none' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><ellipse cx='40' cy='78' rx='8' ry='5' fill='#ffffff' opacity='0.6'/><line x1='50' y1='90' x2='80' y2='90' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='170' cy='90' r='60' fill='#bfdbfe' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><ellipse cx='170' cy='90' rx='60' ry='18' fill='none' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><ellipse cx='148' cy='60' rx='16' ry='10' fill='#ffffff' opacity='0.6'/><line x1='170' y1='90' x2='230' y2='90' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2'/><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='11'><text x='50' y='168'>R = 6 cm</text><text x='170' y='168'>R' = 12 cm</text><text x='50' y='183'>V = 288π</text><text x='170' y='183'>V' = 2304π</text><text x='110' y='168' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='bold'>× 2</text><text x='110' y='183' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='bold'>× 8</text></g></svg></div></div>"
        }
      ]
    },    
    {
      "id": "exo-statistiques-probas",
      "titre": "Traitement des données et Probabilités",
      "exercices": [
        {
          "enonce": "🟢 Niveau Facile\n\nOn lance un dé équilibré à 6 faces. Quelle est la probabilité d'obtenir un multiple de 3 ?\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='75' viewBox='0 0 260 75' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><g fill='#f1f5f9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.5'><rect x='7' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/><rect x='49' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/><rect x='91' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/><rect x='133' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/><rect x='175' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/><rect x='217' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/></g><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='18' font-weight='bold'><text x='25' y='34'>1</text><text x='67' y='34'>2</text><text x='109' y='34'>3</text><text x='151' y='34'>4</text><text x='193' y='34'>5</text><text x='235' y='34'>6</text></g><text x='130' y='64' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#475569'>Les 6 faces du dé</text></svg></div></div>",
          "solution": "Les multiples de 3 entre 1 et 6 sont : 3 et 6, soit 2 issues favorables.\n\nP(multiple de 3) = 2/6 = 1/3\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='75' viewBox='0 0 260 75' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><g fill='#f1f5f9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.5'><rect x='7' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/><rect x='49' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/><rect x='133' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/><rect x='175' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/></g><g fill='#bbf7d0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2'><rect x='91' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/><rect x='217' y='8' width='36' height='36' rx='7'/></g><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='18' font-weight='bold'><text x='25' y='34'>1</text><text x='67' y='34'>2</text><text x='109' y='34'>3</text><text x='151' y='34'>4</text><text x='193' y='34'>5</text><text x='235' y='34'>6</text></g><text x='130' y='64' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#15803d'>Multiples de 3 : 3 et 6 → 2 faces sur 6</text></svg></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟡 Niveau Moyen\n\nVoici les notes sur 20 obtenues par 9 élèves à un devoir :\n7 ; 9 ; 11 ; 11 ; 12 ; 13 ; 14 ; 16 ; 17\na) Calculer la moyenne de la classe.\nb) Déterminer la médiane.",
          "solution": "a) Somme = 7+9+11+11+12+13+14+16+17 = 110\nMoyenne = 110 / 9 ≈ 12,2\n\nb) L'effectif est 9 (impair). La médiane est la 5e valeur (valeur du milieu) de la série déjà rangée par ordre croissant.\nMédiane = 12\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='250' height='98' viewBox='0 0 250 98' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><g fill='#f1f5f9' stroke='#94a3b8'><rect x='8' y='24' width='26' height='28'/><rect x='34' y='24' width='26' height='28'/><rect x='60' y='24' width='26' height='28'/><rect x='86' y='24' width='26' height='28'/><rect x='138' y='24' width='26' height='28'/><rect x='164' y='24' width='26' height='28'/><rect x='190' y='24' width='26' height='28'/><rect x='216' y='24' width='26' height='28'/></g><rect x='112' y='24' width='26' height='28' fill='#fecaca' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2'/><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='11' font-weight='bold'><text x='21' y='43'>7</text><text x='47' y='43'>9</text><text x='73' y='43'>11</text><text x='99' y='43'>11</text><text x='125' y='43' fill='#dc2626'>12</text><text x='151' y='43'>13</text><text x='177' y='43'>14</text><text x='203' y='43'>16</text><text x='229' y='43'>17</text></g><g stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.5'><line x1='8' y1='60' x2='106' y2='60'/><line x1='144' y1='60' x2='242' y2='60'/></g><g text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#475569'><text x='57' y='74'>4 valeurs</text><text x='193' y='74'>4 valeurs</text></g><line x1='125' y1='78' x2='125' y2='60' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='1.5'/><polygon points='125,56 121,63 129,63' fill='#dc2626'/><text x='125' y='92' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' font-weight='bold' fill='#dc2626'>médiane = 12</text></svg></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🟠 Niveau Difficile\n\nUn sac contient 12 boules indiscernables au toucher : 5 rouges, 4 bleues et 3 vertes. On tire une boule au hasard.\na) Quelle est la probabilité de tirer une boule rouge ?\nb) Quelle est la probabilité de ne pas tirer une boule verte ?\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='185' viewBox='0 0 260 185' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect x='50' y='24' width='160' height='126' rx='24' fill='#fef3c7' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='105' y='10' width='50' height='20' rx='5' fill='#fcd34d' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.5'/><g stroke='#1f2937' stroke-width='0.8'><circle cx='82' cy='56' r='14' fill='#ef4444'/><circle cx='118' cy='56' r='14' fill='#3b82f6'/><circle cx='154' cy='56' r='14' fill='#22c55e'/><circle cx='190' cy='56' r='14' fill='#ef4444'/><circle cx='82' cy='92' r='14' fill='#3b82f6'/><circle cx='118' cy='92' r='14' fill='#ef4444'/><circle cx='154' cy='92' r='14' fill='#ef4444'/><circle cx='190' cy='92' r='14' fill='#22c55e'/><circle cx='82' cy='128' r='14' fill='#22c55e'/><circle cx='118' cy='128' r='14' fill='#3b82f6'/><circle cx='154' cy='128' r='14' fill='#ef4444'/><circle cx='190' cy='128' r='14' fill='#3b82f6'/></g><g stroke='#1f2937' stroke-width='0.8'><circle cx='36' cy='170' r='6' fill='#ef4444'/><circle cx='112' cy='170' r='6' fill='#3b82f6'/><circle cx='184' cy='170' r='6' fill='#22c55e'/></g><g fill='#1f2937' font-size='11'><text x='46' y='174'>5 rouges</text><text x='122' y='174'>4 bleues</text><text x='194' y='174'>3 vertes</text></g></svg></div></div>",
          "solution": "a) P(rouge) = 5/12\n\nb) P(verte) = 3/12 = 1/4\nP(ne pas tirer une boule verte) = 1 − P(verte) = 1 − 1/4 = 3/4"
        },
        {
          "enonce": "🔴 Niveau Expert (BEPC)\n\nDans une classe de 30 élèves, on a relevé le nombre de livres lus pendant les vacances :\nNombre de livres : 0 ; 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4\nEffectif : 4 ; 9 ; 10 ; 5 ; 2\n\na) Calculer la moyenne du nombre de livres lus par élève.\nb) On choisit un élève au hasard dans cette classe. Quelle est la probabilité qu'il ait lu au moins 2 livres ?\n\n<div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0'><div style='display:inline-block;background:#ffffff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'><svg width='260' height='190' viewBox='0 0 260 190' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><line x1='30' y1='20' x2='30' y2='150' stroke='#1f2937' stroke-width='1.5'/><line x1='30' y1='150' x2='252' y2='150' stroke='#1f2937' stroke-width='1.5'/><g fill='#60a5fa' stroke='#2563eb'><rect x='40' y='106' width='30' height='44'/><rect x='82' y='51' width='30' height='99'/><rect x='124' y='40' width='30' height='110'/><rect x='166' y='95' width='30' height='55'/><rect x='208' y='128' width='30' height='22'/></g><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='11' font-weight='bold'><text x='55' y='102'>4</text><text x='97' y='47'>9</text><text x='139' y='36'>10</text><text x='181' y='91'>5</text><text x='223' y='124'>2</text></g><g text-anchor='middle' fill='#1f2937' font-size='11'><text x='55' y='166'>0</text><text x='97' y='166'>1</text><text x='139' y='166'>2</text><text x='181' y='166'>3</text><text x='223' y='166'>4</text><text x='141' y='184' fill='#475569'>Nombre de livres lus</text></g><text x='6' y='14' font-size='10' fill='#475569'>Effectif</text></svg></div></div>",
          "solution": "a) On calcule la somme pondérée :\n0×4 + 1×9 + 2×10 + 3×5 + 4×2 = 0 + 9 + 20 + 15 + 8 = 52\nEffectif total = 4+9+10+5+2 = 30\n\nMoyenne = 52 / 30 ≈ 1,73 livre par élève\n\nb) « Au moins 2 livres » correspond aux élèves ayant lu 2, 3 ou 4 livres :\nEffectif favorable = 10 + 5 + 2 = 17\n\nP(au moins 2 livres) = 17/30 ≈ 0,57"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
